-- The weapon wheel in vehicles (Stand's Weapon Wheel In Vehicles): the game's update of the weapon wheel is told
-- the ped is not in a vehicle, so the wheel of the weapons opens while driving (the scroll wheel still goes one by
-- one through the vehicle weapons).
--
--     local wheel = Atdar.util.game.players.user.wheel_on_wheels
--
--     wheel.enable()      -- false if the code of the game is not found or is another one
--     wheel.disable()
--
-- It changes one byte of the code of the game (patch "wheel_on_wheels" of Atdar.natives.memory.patch), not checked in game
local patch_toggle = Atdar.util.game.players.user.patch_toggle

return patch_toggle.make("WheelOnWheels", "wheel_on_wheels")
